# -------------------------------------------
# Empty / Orphaned Directories (cleanup artifacts)
# -------------------------------------------
# NOTE: zk-proof, zk-authenticity, zk-verification were legacy top-level
# folders. They now serve as legacy-URL redirect stubs inside app/[locale]/
# and MUST be tracked. Do not re-add them to this ignore list.
# Same story for privacy/terms/whitepaper: both /app/*/ and
# /app/[locale]/*/ contain redirect stubs that must stay tracked.
# Ignore root-level orphan dirs but keep the app/ redirect stubs.
# `*` matches `[locale]` as a directory name (git treats `[...]` as
# a character class, so a literal `app/[locale]/` pattern would fail).
/privacy/
/terms/
/simulator/
/whitepaper/
!app/privacy/
!app/terms/
!app/whitepaper/
!app/*/privacy/
!app/*/terms/
!app/*/whitepaper/
~/

